.TH DOME-ASKPASS 1 "October 2026" "DomeD" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dome-askpass \- native FLTK password dialog for sudo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dome-askpass
.RI [ prompt ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uses the shared DomeD FLTK toolkit and appearance. Enter submits the password.
Escape, Ctrl+W, closing the window or Cancel abort without password output.
A successful request writes one password line to standard output for sudo.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SUDO_ASKPASS
DomeD sets this to the installed helper for child applications and activated
services unless the caller supplies a value. Use sudo -A to request this dialog.
An empty override disables the default selection.
.TP
.B DISPLAY, WAYLAND_DISPLAY
A graphical display is required. There is no terminal fallback.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/local/share/doc/domed/pinentry
contains upstream source, license and DomeD modifications.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sudo (8),
.BR dome-compositor (1)
